=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$7,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Speed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Speed</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">75 Studs/s</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p>The <b>Joop Grand Barrow</b> is the bigger version of the <a href=\"/wiki/Joop_Barrow\" title=\"Joop Barrow\">Joop Barrow</a>, having a bigger payload and an extra seat. It costs $7,000 and can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot.</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The part of the name \"Joop\" is reference to the real life car brand Jeep</li>\n<li>The license plate is loosely based on the Alabama plate. Mainly that they share the tagline \"Sweet Home\" followed by the Vehicle registration then the place of origin.</li>\n<li>Before v1.52.0 price was $5,499</li>\n<li>in v1.52.0 price was $10,998</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163342\nC